
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>직원 목록 조회 - 병원 관리 시스템</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      background: #f3f6fb;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #24364b;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1150px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: white;
      padding: 32px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
    }

    .header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 27px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: #69788a;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .logout {
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 7px;
      background: #e9edf4;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .summary {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      padding: 15px 18px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: #edf4ff;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #2457a6;
    }

    .table-wrap {
      overflow-x: auto;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      text-align: center;
    }

    th {
      background: #2d6cdf;
      color: white;
      padding: 14px 10px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    td {
      padding: 14px 10px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e5eaf0;
    }

    tbody tr:hover {
      background: #f6f9ff;
    }

    .status {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 5px 10px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 13px;
      background: #e6f5ec;
      color: #168044;
    }

    .status.retired {
      background: #f0f0f0;
      color: #777;
    }

    .empty {
      padding: 40px;
      color: #777;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="container">

    <div class="header">
      <div>
        <h1>직원 목록 조회</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">
          관리자 <%= adminName %>님 · 직원 정보 관리
        </p>
      </div>

      <form action="/auth/logout" method="POST">
        <button class="logout" type="submit">
          로그아웃
        </button>
      </form>
    </div>

    <div class="summary">
      전체 직원 <%= employees.length %>명
      |
      재직 직원
      <%= employees.filter(e => e.emp_status === '재직').length %>명
    </div>

    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>직원번호</th>
            <th>직원명</th>
            <th>직종</th>
            <th>면허번호</th>
            <th>아이디</th>
            <th>부서명</th>
            <th>재직상태</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>

        <tbody>
          <% if (employees.length === 0) { %>
            <tr>
              <td colspan="7" class="empty">
                등록된 직원이 없습니다.
              </td>
            </tr>
          <% } else { %>
            <% employees.forEach(employee => { %>
              <tr>
                <td><%= employee.employee_no %></td>
                <td><%= employee.employee_name %></td>
                <td><%= employee.job_type %></td>
                <td><%= employee.license_no || '-' %></td>
                <td><%= employee.username %></td>
                <td>
                  <%= employee.dept_name || employee.dept_code %>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="status <%= employee.emp_status === '재직' ? '' : 'retired' %>">
                    <%= employee.emp_status %>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
            <% }); %>
          <% } %>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
